 ns←RedirectToCustomIDs ns;bool;from;to
⍝ Short bookmark links ("[Caption](#)") are compiled from their link text. When the header with that
⍝ caption carries a custom ID ("{#xyz}") they must point to that ID instead.
⍝ A name that is the bookmark of another header is left alone; with duplicate captions the first one wins.
 :If 0≠≢ns.customIDs
     bool←~ns.customIDs[;1]∊ns.headers[;2]
     bool∧←≠ns.customIDs[;1]
 :AndIf ∨/bool
     (from to)←↓⍉bool⌿ns.customIDs
     from←{'href="#',(MakeLiteralForRegex ⍵),'"'}¨from
     to←{'href="#',⍵,'"'}¨to
     ns.html←((⊂'<code>.*?</code>'),from)⎕R((⊂'\0'),to)⍠('Mode' 'D')('DotAll' 1)⊣ns.html
 :EndIf
